---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Nos Projets - Y'EN A MARRE" currentPath="/projets">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[60vh] bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-black overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Background pattern -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('/placeholder.svg?height=600&width=1200&query=Abstract pattern dots')] bg-repeat"></div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="container-custom relative z-20 h-full flex flex-col justify-center py-20 md:py-32">
      <div class="text-white text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6">
          Nos <span class="text-yam-red">Projets</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Découvrez les différentes initiatives de Y'EN A MARRE pour promouvoir la démocratie, la bonne gouvernance et l'engagement civique.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Wave divider -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1440 120" class="w-full h-auto">
        <path fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="1" d="M0,64L80,69.3C160,75,320,85,480,80C640,75,800,53,960,48C1120,43,1280,53,1360,58.7L1440,64L1440,120L1360,120C1280,120,1120,120,960,120C800,120,640,120,480,120C320,120,160,120,80,120L0,120Z"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Introduction Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
          L'écosystème Y'EN A MARRE
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Y'EN A MARRE développe plusieurs projets complémentaires pour maximiser son impact sur la société sénégalaise et africaine. Chaque projet répond à des besoins spécifiques tout en contribuant à notre mission globale de promotion de la démocratie et de l'engagement citoyen.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Projects Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto">

        <!-- Lead The Change (LTC) -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 transform hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="relative h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-black">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/placeholder.svg?height=400&width=600&query=TV studio with African journalists')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-20"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <img 
                src="https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/logo-ltc-8W4L2tgdjU72mMqlBWEQghrV3Vj7Z1.png" 
                alt="Lead The Change (LTC)" 
                class="w-32 h-32 object-contain"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Lead The Change (LTC)</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              La télé citoyenne qui informe, éduque et mobilise les citoyens à travers des programmes télévisés innovants et des contenus numériques engagés.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
              <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-2 text-black" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Programmes TV et contenus digitaux</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-2 text-black" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Formation de Jeunes Reporters Citoyens</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-2 text-black" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 4V2a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 011 1v2M7 4h10M7 4L5.05 5.95A1 1 0 005 6.364V19a1 1 0 001 1h12a1 1 0 001-1V6.364a1 1 0 00-.05-.414L17 4M9 12h6" />
                </svg>
                <span>Débats et analyses politiques</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/ltc" class="inline-flex items-center bg-black text-white hover:bg-gray-800 font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all transform hover:scale-105">
              Découvrir LTC
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Karibu -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 transform hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="relative h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-karibu-green to-green-700">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/placeholder.svg?height=400&width=600&query=African artists in workshop')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-20"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <img 
                src="https://hebbkx1anhila5yf.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/logo-karibu-fkSP6Sl0AUSZtdNJdL0POuaoH1uL4F.png" 
                alt="Karibu" 
                class="w-32 h-32 object-contain"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Karibu</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Résidences artistiques et mobilités citoyennes qui promeuvent l'engagement artistique et citoyen à travers des échanges culturels et éducatifs.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
              <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-2 text-karibu-green" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9v-9m0 9c0 5 0 5 0 5s0 0 0-5m0 9c-5 0-9-4-9-9s4-9 9-9m0 9c0-5 0-5 0-5s0 0 0 5" />
                </svg>
                <span>Mobilités citoyennes régionales</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-2 text-karibu-green" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zM21 5a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 2 0 00-2 2v12a4 4 0 004 4h4a2 2 0 002-2V5z" />
                </svg>
                <span>Résidences artistiques</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-600">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 mr-2 text-karibu-green" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
                </svg>
                <span>Production de savoir et connaissances</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/karibu" class="inline-flex items-center bg-karibu-green text-white hover:bg-green-700 font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-all transform hover:scale-105">
              Découvrir Karibu
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Impact Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Impact de nos projets</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Ensemble, nos projets créent un écosystème complet pour le développement démocratique et citoyen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="bg-yam-red text-white rounded-full w-16 h-16 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Sensibilisation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Formation et sensibilisation de milliers de jeunes citoyens engagés</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="bg-karibu-green text-white rounded-full w-16 h-16 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9v-9m0 9c0 5 0 5 0 5s0 0 0-5m0 9c-5 0-9-4-9-9s4-9 9-9m0 9c0-5 0-5 0-5s0 0 0 5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Mobilisation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Mobilisation citoyenne à travers l'art, la culture et les médias</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center p-6">
          <div class="bg-black text-white rounded-full w-16 h-16 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Transformation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Changement positif dans la gouvernance et la participation citoyenne</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Call to Action -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-yam-red to-red-700 text-white">
    <div class="container-custom text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Rejoignez nos projets</h2>
      <p class="text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Participez à la construction d'une société plus démocratique et engagée. Découvrez comment vous pouvez contribuer à nos initiatives.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn bg-white text-yam-red hover:bg-gray-100 transform transition-all hover:scale-105 py-3 px-8 rounded-lg font-bold">
        Nous contacter
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>